Before you answer, check four things. Every option is a NAME with nothing explaining it. No option is marked, tinted or ordered to give the answer away. The first beat is "ask" and the second is "options". And the narration fields together contain {{.MinWords}}-{{.MaxWords}} words, targeting {{.TargetWords}}.
